 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The technique of argumentative concession",
     "texto": [
      "In academic, legal and arbitration discourse, a solid argument begins by partially recognising the validity of the counterpart's objections, and then makes its own thesis prevail. To structure this balance, concessive and adversative connectors are used such as **zwar … aber / dennoch / trotzdem**: **Zwar ist das Vorhaben kostenintensiv, dennoch überwiegen die langfristigen Vorteile** (although the project is costly, nevertheless the long-term advantages prevail)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Positional rules of dennoch and trotzdem",
     "texto": [
      "After a sentence introduced by **zwar**, the connector **dennoch** usually acts as a connecting adverb in the first position of the main clause, causing the immediate inversion of the finite verb (**V2**): **dennoch bietet die Maßnahme entscheidende Garantien** (nevertheless the measure offers decisive guarantees)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Structure",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Discursive function",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "zwar …, dennoch + V2",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Concession and weighted refutation",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Zwar gab es Verzögerungen, dennoch steht das Ergebnis.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "einerseits …, andererseits",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Weighing of two aspects",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Einerseits spart man Zeit, andererseits steigen Ausgaben.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "zugeben / einräumen",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Explicit formal concession",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Man muss einräumen, dass Risiken bestehen.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
